				<title>战争雷霆11月贴花活动开启：五款历史贴花限时任务与刷取指南</title>
				<link>https://info.steamhunter.link/posts/2026-11-12-236390-6c7c0cad/</link>
				<pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 19:18:55 +0800</pubDate>
